{
  "bookId": "hero-213201",
  "id": "bond-28531",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28531001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "今天没有么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28531003",
              "text": "没有什么？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28531002",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28531003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "猫毛，我的袖口沾了猫毛。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28531005",
              "text": "是吗？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "28531005",
              "text": "嗯嗯，然后呢？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28531004",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28531005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "该履行你的义务了，后宅扫灰。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28531006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我记得我今天扫过了喔？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28531007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "卡缪看起来很干净，一根猫毛都没有。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28531008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "哼。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28531009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "粮丸",
          "text": "嗷嗷喵——！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28531010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "看，猫毛，现在你必须打扫了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28531012",
              "text": "不要欺负大猫。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "28531012",
              "text": "卡缪原来是个傲娇吗？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28531011",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28531012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "不要揣测神。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28531013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "是是~不过说起来，卡缪几乎是手办里最高的呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28531014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "仰视我，这是他们该做的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28531015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "——你也不例外。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28531016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不过去掉底座的话，卡缪似乎只有……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28531017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "拿开手，你可以退下了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "28531",
